      "id": "s1",
      "type": "info",
      "text": "**TEXTBEFORE** extracts text before a delimiter, while `TEXTAFTER` takes text after it: `=TEXTBEFORE(text, delimiter)` and `=TEXTAFTER(text, delimiter)`. Delimiters like `\"@\"` or `\"-\"` go in quotation marks."
